    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Advances the rollup state to a new block hash and posts new withdrawable\\nbalances plus fees.\\n\\n# Arguments\\n\\n* `env` - Access to the Soroban environment.\\n* `old_block_hash` - Expected current block hash.\\n* `new_block_hash` - New block hash to commit.\\n* `new_withdrawal_addresses` - Addresses receiving newly posted\\nwithdrawal allowances.\\n* `new_withdrawal_amounts` - Amounts paired by index with\\n`new_withdrawal_addresses`.\\n* `new_withdrawal_sum` - Sum of all new withdrawal amounts.\\n* `new_fees` - Fees accrued in the new rollup block.\\n\\n# Errors\\n\\n* [`ContractError::NewBlockHashEmpty`] - If `new_block_hash` is zero.\\n* [`ContractError::OldBlockHashMismatch`] - If `old_block_hash` does not\\nmatch the currently stored block hash.\\n* [`ContractError::BlockHashUnchanged`] - If the new block hash is equal\\nto the old block hash.\\n* [`ContractError::ArrayLengthMismatch`] - If the address and amount\\narrays have different lengths.\\n* [`ContractError::ArrayLengthExceedsLimit`] - If more than 100\\nwithdrawal entries are posted.\\n* [`C",
      "name": "rollup",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "old_block_hash",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "new_block_hash",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "new_withdrawal_addresses",
          "type_": {
            "vec": {
              "element_type": "address"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "new_withdrawal_amounts",
          "type_": {
            "vec": {
              "element_type": "i128"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "new_withdrawal_sum",
          "type_": "i128"
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "new_fees",
          "type_": "i128"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": {
              "tuple": {
                "value_types": []
              }
            },
            "error_type": {
              "udt": {
                "name": "ContractError"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
